    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Not directly for math, but I used AI tools like chatbots for language or research. For math, I’d imagine something like *Wolfram Alpha* breaking down problems visually—like a garden tool helping me prune ideas. It’s not my strength, but curiosity drives me to explore.",
